1
00:00:02,293 --> 00:00:05,880
You don't seem to be
doing so well these days.

2
00:00:06,056 --> 00:00:08,517
I'm fine.

3
00:00:08,614 --> 00:00:10,657
Just a little tired today.

4
00:00:10,706 --> 00:00:11,999
Don't push yourself.

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,362
Recovery comes first.

6
00:00:16,307 --> 00:00:20,478
Oh, by the way, did Jeong-min
get in touch with you?

7
00:00:20,478 --> 00:00:23,189
Oh, that...

8
00:00:24,149 --> 00:00:27,318
I decided not to
go through with it.

9
00:00:27,861 --> 00:00:30,238
I see. That's a shame

10
00:00:30,238 --> 00:00:33,241
but another chance will come.

11
00:00:38,038 --> 00:00:41,041
What is it? Still hurting?

12
00:00:41,339 --> 00:00:44,342
No, I'm fine.

13
00:00:49,257 --> 00:00:52,260
Higher. Come on, higher!

14
00:00:54,426 --> 00:00:55,426
Hey...

15
00:00:57,307 --> 00:00:59,434
Are you sure this is okay?

16
00:00:59,434 --> 00:01:00,935
You want to

17
00:01:00,935 --> 00:01:02,228
go pro or not?

18
00:01:02,687 --> 00:01:05,815
But my knee...

19
00:01:06,349 --> 00:01:08,101
Seung‑hyun

20
00:01:08,443 --> 00:01:10,445
do you know why
I'm helping you?

21
00:01:10,445 --> 00:01:11,446
I mean, I guess...

22
00:01:11,446 --> 00:01:14,783
I want Ji-sung
to come back to me.

23
00:01:16,493 --> 00:01:18,745
Don't know if he told you

24
00:01:18,745 --> 00:01:21,873
but I'm that younger colleague
he used to care about.

25
00:01:23,875 --> 00:01:26,878
You're that younger colleague?

26
00:01:27,087 --> 00:01:30,465
Yep. We're seeing each other
again, actually.

27
00:01:31,508 --> 00:01:33,218
Said he couldn't leave

28
00:01:33,218 --> 00:01:36,221
till you recovered...
or something like that.

29
00:01:36,221 --> 00:01:37,764
That can't be right...

30
00:01:37,764 --> 00:01:41,643
He probably didn't say
anything to keep it quiet.

31
00:01:41,643 --> 00:01:44,646
You know how careful he is.

32
00:01:45,271 --> 00:01:46,147
Yeah...

33
00:01:46,147 --> 00:01:48,274
Look, now that you know

34
00:01:48,274 --> 00:01:50,610
keep your distance.

35
00:01:50,610 --> 00:01:52,112
Be professional.

36
00:01:52,112 --> 00:01:55,532
And once this is over
let's walk away for good.

37
00:01:56,241 --> 00:01:58,618
Got it?

38
00:01:59,577 --> 00:02:00,662
Yeah...
